    howItWorksEn: 'Option A (Luxury @ ₹10) vs Option B (Standard @ ₹1) -> Both reduced by ₹1 -> Option A @ ₹9 vs Option B @ Free -> Brain perceives zero risk in B -> Disregards superior value in A -> Chooses inferior free item.',
